YNW Melly’s mother shared a heartfelt message about how much she misses her son as he approaches eight years behind bars 💔 “Almost 8 years later and my heart still aches everyday,” she wrote on Instagram. “My 1st born my first heartbeat. I’m just waiting patiently for you to come home.” 🙏🏽 Her words focused on the pain of being separated from her firstborn and her continued hope that they’ll be reunited. ❤️

Be real—y’all feeling this one?

